---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import StayInTouch from '../components/StayInTouch.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Search OC | Questions about God? You are not the only one."
	description="A safe place in Orange County to ask them out loud. Open Forums are hosted conversations about God. Believers and unbelievers are both welcome."
	canonical="/"
	ogImage="/og/home.png"
>

<!-- Hero: Open Forum invite -->
<section class="hero-photo hero-photo--amber">
	<div class="hero-photo__media" aria-hidden="true">
		<img
			src="/images/dinner-party.jpg"
			alt=""
			width="2400"
			height="1350"
			fetchpriority="high"
		/>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-photo__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="hero-photo__content">
		<p class="brand-mark rise-in">Search OC</p>
		<p class="mt-3 font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/85 rise-in rise-in-delay-1">Open Forums</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-[2.75rem] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.12] rise-in rise-in-delay-1">
			Questions about God? You are not the only one.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-5 lead max-w-xl rise-in rise-in-delay-2">
			Search OC hosts Open Forums: a table in Orange County for honest conversation about God, faith, and life's big questions. Believers and unbelievers can both pull up a chair.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 rise-in rise-in-delay-3">
			<a href="#stay-in-touch" class="btn-amber inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-11">Keep me posted</a>
			<a href="/open-forums" class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-11">See what a night looks like</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<img
	class="sr-only"
	src="/images/dinner-party.jpg"
	alt="Friends gathered around a dinner table with food and candles"
/>

<!-- What it is -->
<section class="section">
	<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
		<div class="max-w-3xl">
			<Eyebrow text="What this is" />
			<h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">A table for honest questions</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 lead">
				An Open Forum is a hosted conversation over food and drinks. About an hour. No sermon. No pressure to believe anything. Room for the questions you actually have.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
				That table is Search OC's public invite. You do not need to pick a program first. Curious people and people of faith can sit together and talk.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
			<div class="card h-full">
				<p class="font-sans font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Truly open</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
					Doubt, anger, and skepticism are welcome. You do not have to be a Christian to come, and you do not have to agree with anyone in the room.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card h-full">
				<p class="font-sans font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">One honest hour</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
					Food and drinks, a moderated conversation, then optional lingering if you want it. Come once. No commitment required.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card h-full">
				<p class="font-sans font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Guests speak first</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
					Your questions lead. The host shares a viewpoint later in the night, not first. You can listen the whole time if you prefer.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<figure class="media-band">
	<img
		src="/images/forum-discussion.jpg"
		alt="Friends laughing around a table with books and coffee during an evening discussion"
		width="2400"
		height="1350"
		loading="lazy"
	/>
	<figcaption class="media-band__caption">Food, drinks, and honest questions. That is the whole night.</figcaption>
</figure>

<!-- Who it's for -->
<section class="section-warm section">
	<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
		<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
			<div>
				<Eyebrow text="Who it is for" />
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--search-blue-action)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span> People curious about God but unsure where to start.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--search-blue-action)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span> People with doubts, questions, or past church baggage.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--search-blue-action)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span> People of faith who want a safe table to bring a friend.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--search-blue-action)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span> People who may come once and decide that is enough for now.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<Eyebrow text="What it is not" variant="amber" />
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--orange)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span> A church service, sermon, or altar call.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--orange)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span> A debate club or a sales pitch for faith.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--orange)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span> A class, a course, or homework.</li>
					<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[var(--orange)] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span> Content for social media about who attended.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<!-- Who hosts -->
<section class="section-blue overflow-hidden">
	<div class="split-media">
		<div class="split-media__image order-2 md:order-1">
			<img
				src="/images/marketplace-talk.jpg"
				alt="A man gesturing warmly while talking across a cafe table"
				width="2400"
				height="1350"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>
		<div class="order-1 md:order-2 px-6 py-12 md:py-16 md:px-10 flex items-center">
			<div class="max-w-xl">
				<p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--lime)]">Search OC</p>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
					Forty years of tables in Orange County
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 text-white leading-relaxed">
					Search OC is a local expression of Search Ministries. We host Open Forums because honest conversation about God still needs a room that is not a pulpit and not a performance.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-white leading-relaxed">
					If you have a question, you belong at the table. If you have a friend with a question, you can bring them. That is the whole public invite.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<!-- Invite a friend -->
<section class="section">
	<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
		<div class="max-w-2xl">
			<Eyebrow text="Already thinking of someone?" />
			<h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">The ask is smaller than you think</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">
				You are not inviting anyone to church. You are inviting them to one table, for one hour, to talk about one honest question. They can come once and never come back, and nothing about your friendship has to change.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-6">
				<a href="/invite" class="font-sans font-semibold text-[var(--orange-action)] hover:underline">
					Here is how to ask &rarr;
				</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<figure class="media-band" style="min-height: 14rem;">
	<img
		src="/images/patio-gathering.jpg"
		alt="A diverse group of friends laughing around an outdoor patio table"
		width="2400"
		height="1350"
		loading="lazy"
	/>
	<figcaption class="media-band__caption">Eight to twelve people. One table. Room for honest questions.</figcaption>
</figure>

<StayInTouch
	id="stay-in-touch"
	eyebrow="Take the next step"
	title="Want the next Open Forum date?"
	body="Sign up and we will let you know when the next table is set. No pressure, no spam."
	source="home"
	variant="blue"
	submitLabel="Keep me posted"
	defaultInterests={['open-forums']}
	showFormationInterest={false}
	defaultNewsletter={false}
/>
</Layout>
